---
// How it works: point the camera, it reads every line, see where it goes.
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import { S2, S3, S3_TOTAL, STUBS, eur } from '../../data/anims';
import { cat } from '../../data/categories';
---
<ol class="steps" data-anim="steps">
  <li class="step" data-step>
    <div class="title"><span class="n">1</span><h3>Point the camera</h3></div>
    <div class="stage dark" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="doc">
        <div class="edge is-locked" data-edge></div>
        <div class="sheet"><div class="top"></div>{STUBS.map((w) => <div class="stub" style={`width:${w}`}></div>)}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint"><span data-hint>Captured</span></div>
    </div>
    <p>Sumsnapp opens straight to the camera and captures the receipt when it's steady. Or upload a photo, screenshot or PDF.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="step" data-step>
    <div class="title"><span class="n">2</span><h3>It reads every line</h3></div>
    <div class="stage inset" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="paper mini">{S2.map((r) => <div class="pl" data-s2paper style="background:rgba(30,106,76,.18)"><span>{r[0]}</span><span>{r[1]}</span></div>)}</div>
      <div class="rows">
        {S2.map((r) => {
          const c = cat(r[3]);
          return (
            <div class="r ease-pop" data-s2row>
              <span class="cat-tile t" style={`background:${c.color}`}><Icon name={c.icon} fill size={13} /></span>
              <span class="rn">{r[2]}</span><span class="num">{r[4]}</span>
            </div>
          );
        })}
      </div>
      <span class="pill sm" data-s2pill><Icon name="check_circle" fill size={14} />Matches receipt total</span>
    </div>
    <p>Store, date, items, quantities, weights, discounts, tax and total. It checks the lines add up and flags any it's unsure about.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="step is-active" data-step>
    <div class="title"><span class="n">3</span><h3>See where it goes</h3></div>
    <div class="stage inset pad" aria-hidden="true">
      <div><div class="month">October</div><div class="big rounded num" data-s3total>{eur(S3_TOTAL)}</div></div>
      {S3.map(([k, a]) => {
        const c = cat(k);
        return (
          <div class="bar">
            <div class="bl"><span>{c.name}</span><span class="num">{eur(a)}</span></div>
            <div class="track"><div class="fill" data-s3bar style={`width:${(a / S3[0][1]) * 100}%;background:${c.color}`}></div></div>
          </div>
        );
      })}
    </div>
    <p>Spending by week, month, 3 months or year, by category, top items and store, with the change from the period before.</p>
  </li>
</ol>

<style>
  .steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); }
  .step { border-radius: 24px; background: var(--card); padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: box-shadow .4s; }
  .step.is-active { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent); }
  .title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .title h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
  .n { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 15px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: var(--fill); transition: background .3s; }
  .is-active .n { background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); }
  p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--text2); }
  .stage { height: 250px; border-radius: 16px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .dark { background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 40%, #3A3631, #141312); }
  /* At least the design's height, taller when the receipt and its rows need it. */
  .inset { height: auto; min-height: 250px; background: var(--bg); padding: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .pad { padding: 16px; gap: 12px; }
  .doc { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 26px; width: 118px; margin-left: -59px; transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .edge { position: absolute; inset: -10px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .75); transform: scale(1.12); transition: transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2, .9, .3, 1.3), border-color .3s; }
  .edge.is-locked { border-color: #6FD3A0; transform: scale(1); }
  .sheet { height: 190px; background: var(--paper); padding: 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .top { height: 4px; width: 55%; margin: 0 auto 6px; background: #9A968E; }
  .stub { height: 3px; background: #C9C5BC; }
  .hint { position: absolute; bottom: 12px; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .hint span { padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .6); color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
  .mini { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.55; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .pl { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 3px; border-radius: 2px; transition: background .3s; }
  .rows { border-radius: 12px; background: var(--card); overflow: hidden; }
  .r { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .t { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .rn { flex: 1; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .pill.sm { align-self: flex-start; height: 24px; padding: 0 9px; font-size: 12px; transition: opacity .3s; }
  .month { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text3); }
  .big { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; }
  .bar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .bl { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 13px; }
  .track { height: 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--fill); overflow: hidden; }
  .fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(.2, .9, .3, 1); }
</style>
